sdc4:mc-sl027mwr4zjo3ht4yeslb0ti-shape a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:label "Property Registry Access Control" ;
    rdfs:comment "Access control policy for property registration data using W3C Data Privacy Vocabulary. Enforces role-based access for registry officials, property owners, and legal representatives. Governs dpv:FinancialData including title deeds, cadastral records, and encumbrance filings." ;
